        "text_7q3NWD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Strong adhesive tapes are used throughout the retail industry, from product displays to signs and price tags. Retailers rely on both standard and custom adhesive solutions to attract customers, share information, secure bags, and even direct foot traffic through a store, while manufacturers require creative packaging and labeling for the product itself and shipping purposes.</p><p></p>",
